# Mobile / responsive layout

- Breakpoints live only in:
  - `frontend/src/app/core/layout/layout-breakpoints.ts` (`LAYOUT_BP`, `LAYOUT_QUERIES`)
  - `frontend/src/styles/_breakpoints.scss` (mixins: `handset`, `tablet-up`, `desktop`, `below-desktop`, `compact-split`, `grid-2col`, `grid-3col`)
- JS viewport state: inject `LayoutService` (`isHandset`, `isTablet`, `isDesktop`, `isCompactSplit`, `handsetPageSize`). Do not use local `MediaMatcher` / raw `matchMedia` on feature pages.
- SCSS: `@use 'breakpoints' as bp;` then `@include bp.handset { ... }`. No ad-hoc `@media (max-width: Npx)`.
- Allowed named grid exceptions: `$grid-2col-min` (840), `$grid-3col-min` (1320) via mixins only.
- Page padding / title: CSS vars `--page-padding-*`, `--page-title-size` from `_page-layout.scss` (set on shell `.content`).
- Admin tables: wrap in `.table-shell` (horizontal scroll). Forms dialogs: `getHandsetFriendlyDialogConfig` / `dialog-shell--handset-fullscreen`.
- Comments in code: Ukrainian.
